{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"category":"Orange Unified Design System","categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)","role":"project","title":"Going further with more resources"},"sections":[{"title":"Going further with more resources","kind":"hero","backgroundImage":"ic_theme_intro.png","estimatedTimeInMinutes":10,"image":"ic_theme_intro.png","chapter":"Go further with more ressources","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Since you have learned how OUDS works with theme, themeable view, components, tuning and view modifiers, it is time now to discover some online resources.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"tasks","tasks":[{"stepsSection":[{"runtimePreview":null,"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-1.png","type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The iOS technical documentation is available online. It has been generated from all the Swift DocC documentation written in the Swift Package."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You will find several catalogs (as many as libraries) with details about everything: components, tokens, themes, providers, etc."}]}],"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can get it at "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/"}]}],"code":null},{"runtimePreview":null,"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-2.png","type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The whole design system is documented and available online. You can find everything about components, tokens, guidelines and principles of OUDS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"icon finder","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is also available there to get icons for your projects."}]}],"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Go to the website and learn things at "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com\/"}]}],"code":null},{"runtimePreview":null,"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-3.png","type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS iOS provides also a wiki attached to its GitHub repository. The wiki is a public base of knowledge with plenty of things: available API, technical architecture, tips about processes, tests, conventions and toolings."}]}],"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Have a look "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki"},{"type":"text","text":" to discover how OUDS works."}]}],"code":null},{"runtimePreview":null,"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-4.png","type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For technical reasons the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios"},{"type":"text","text":" GitHub repository does not embed the source code of the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"design system toolbox","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" app. In fact this app and all its snapshots for tests increases a lot the size of the repository."}]}],"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To get the source code of this showcase app, go to its dedicated GitHub repository at "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox"}]}],"code":null},{"runtimePreview":null,"media":"tutorial-discovery-6-5.png","type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS is open source, public and uses GitHub as forge. Thus, you will find common things inside the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios"},{"type":"text","text":" GitHub repository."}]}],"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do not hesitate to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/issues"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/discussions"},{"type":"text","text":"!"}]}],"code":null}],"contentSection":[{"kind":"contentAndMedia","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode can use the Swift DocC documentation of OUDS, and this documentation is used to build a static web site."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"But there are also other resources which can be useful for you."}]}],"mediaPosition":"trailing"}],"anchor":"More-resources","title":"More resources"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-onboarding-4-going-further"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)\/$volume","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)\/Go-further-with-more-ressources"]],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)","modules":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(onboarding)\/Import-of-the-Swift-Package-and-choose-its-libraries","projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-libraries","sections":[{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-libraries#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries"},{"kind":"assessment","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-libraries#Check-Your-Understanding"}]}]